// Article 2. Decisions.
#require "1-members.charter".
Module poll(subject) {
  Fact yes Identified by person * subject
  Act vote Actor member Related to subject
    Holds when True
    Creates yes(member, subject)
  Fact majority Identified by subject
    Derived from majority(yes.subject)
      When Sum(Foreach capital: capital.int When yes(capital.person, yes.subject)) * 2 > total-capital
  Fact three-quarters Identified by subject
    Derived from three-quarters(yes.subject)
      When Sum(Foreach capital: capital.int When yes(capital.person, yes.subject)) * 4 >= total-capital * 3
  Fact unanimous Identified by subject
    Derived from unanimous(yes.subject)
      When !(Exists person: member(person) && !yes(person, yes.subject))
}

Placeholder candidate For person
Fact matter Identified by SellTheBusiness
Use poll(candidate) As admission From 2.1
Use poll(matter) As matter From 2.1

Bool business-sold
Power admit Actor company Recipient candidate
  Valid when admission-unanimous(candidate)
  Creates member(candidate)
Power sell-business Actor company
  Valid when matter-unanimous(SellTheBusiness)
  Creates business-sold

Clause 2.1 => admission-vote, matter-vote
Clause 2.2 Definition
Clause 2.3 => admit, sell-business
Clause 2.4 => admit, sell-business.
